<title>UK: Bancomer sets 200 mln Mexican peso one-year CD.</title>
<headline>Bancomer sets 200 mln Mexican peso one-year CD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Certificate of Deposit was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCOMER LONDON BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN PESO  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    08.JUL.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 CD	  ISS PRICE  80.756    PAY DATE    08.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M   1.3</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS MEXICO   REOFF YIELD 23.375</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
